{"parse": {"title": "“哐啷哐啷”小火车", "pageid": 68992, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"user-select:none; pointer-events:none; position:relative; z-index:-1;\"></div><div class=\"antique-content\"><div class=\"antique-img\"><div style=\"margin-top:-13%;\"><img alt=\"“哐啷哐啷”小火车\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/29/Antique-v2a2_antique_icon_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"“哐啷哐啷”小火车\" width=\"700\" height=\"728\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"728\" /></div><div style=\"position:absolute;width: 40%;height: 34%;right:20%;top: 76%;text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Signature-501204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/50/Signature-501204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"264\" height=\"214\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"264\" data-file-height=\"214\" /></div></div><div style=\"max-width:600px; margin: 35px 20px 0 20px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 5px black;\">它看起来东拼西凑，锈迹斑斑，却在庆典中广受欢迎——它高扬汽笛，满载糖果，带着所有好奇的目光一同，向庆典最热闹之处奔去。<div class=\"test-hide hide-m grey-small\" style=\"float:right; margin-top:40px\">编号ID：221001</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E6.9D.A5.E6.BA.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"来源\">来源</span></h2><div class=\"no-indent\" style=\"text-align:center; max-width:500px\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%91%E5%BA%86%E5%85%B8%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%91%EF%BC%81\" title=\"向庆典出发！\"><img alt=\"向庆典出发！.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/%E5%90%91%E5%BA%86%E5%85%B8%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%91%EF%BC%81.jpg/500px-%E5%90%91%E5%BA%86%E5%85%B8%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%91%EF%BC%81.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/%E5%90%91%E5%BA%86%E5%85%B8%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%91%EF%BC%81.jpg/750px-%E5%90%91%E5%BA%86%E5%85%B8%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%91%EF%BC%81.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/%E5%90%91%E5%BA%86%E5%85%B8%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%91%EF%